---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import content from '../../i18n/de/docs';
import { t } from '../../i18n/ui';

const lang = 'de';
---

<Layout
  title="Dokumentation — CIPHER-MUX"
  description={content.hero.body}
  lang={lang}
  active="docs"
>
  <div class="docs-page">

    <!-- Anchor Nav -->
    <nav class="cm-anchor-nav">
      <div class="cm-anchor-nav-label">{t(lang, 'scroll.label')}</div>
      {content.sections.map((section) => (
        <a href={`#${section.id}`} class="cm-anchor-nav-item">
          <span class="cm-anchor-nav-num">{section.num}</span>
          <span>{section.navLabel}</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="docs-hero">
      <div class="cm-tag">{content.hero.kicker}</div>
      <h1>{content.hero.title}<br /><span class="accent">{content.hero.titleAccent}</span> {content.hero.titleEnd}</h1>
      <p class="docs-body">{content.hero.body}</p>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Companion Intro (before §01) ═══ -->
    <section class="docs-companion-intro">
      <div class="docs-inner">
        <div class="cm-tag">{content.companionIntro.kicker}</div>
        <h2>{content.companionIntro.title}</h2>
        <p class="docs-p" set:html={content.companionIntro.body1} />
        <p class="docs-p" set:html={content.companionIntro.body2} />

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>{content.companionIntro.startTitle}</span></h3>
        <ul class="docs-list">
          {content.companionIntro.startItems.map((item) => (
            <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span set:html={item} /></li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>{content.companionIntro.modesTitle}</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-table">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col">
            <div>Modus</div><div>Beschreibung</div>
          </div>
          {content.companionIntro.modes.map((m, i) => (
            <div class:list={["docs-table-row", "docs-table-2col", { "docs-table-row-first": i === 0 }]}>
              <div class="docs-table-label">{m.label}</div>
              <div class="docs-table-desc">{m.desc}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="docs-callout docs-callout-rule">
          <div class="docs-callout-label">Faustregel · {content.companionIntro.ruleTitle}</div>
          <div class="docs-callout-body" set:html={content.companionIntro.ruleBody} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ §01 · Das Fenster verstehen ═══ -->
    <section id="window" class="docs-section">
      <div class="docs-inner">
        <div class="cm-section-header-meta">
          <span class="cm-section-header-num">§ 01</span>
          <span class="cm-section-header-line"></span>
          <span>kapitel</span>
        </div>
        <h2>Das Fenster verstehen</h2>
        <p class="docs-lead">Wenn cipher-mux startet, siehst du zwei Bereiche: das Grid in der Mitte, die Statusleiste am unteren Rand. Mehr ist's erstmal nicht.</p>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Das Grid (Hauptbereich)</span></h3>
        <p class="docs-p">Der große zentrale Bereich. Hier leben deine Sessions — jede in einer eigenen Zelle. Stell dir einen Schreibtisch mit mehreren Bildschirmen vor: Jeder Bildschirm zeigt eine eigene Claude-Unterhaltung.</p>
        <p class="docs-p">Eine leere Zelle zeigt ein <span class="docs-mono">+</span> in der Mitte. Klick darauf öffnet das <strong>Launcher-Popup</strong> — dein Einstiegspunkt für alles.</p>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Launcher-Popup · drei Tabs</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-table">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col"><div>Tab</div><div>Zweck</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-label">Presets</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Spezialisierte Rollen direkt starten — alle verfügbaren Presets als Karten (Companion, Refinement, Cyber Factory, …). Laufende Single-Instance-Presets sind mit einem Punkt markiert. Resume-Button für bestehende Sessions.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Path</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Session mit eigenem Projekt-Pfad starten. Ordner-Picker, zuletzt genutzte Pfade, plus Optionen: Shell Only · Skip Permissions · Resume · Fork.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Notes</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Bestehende Notiz in dieser Zelle öffnen oder neue Notiz anlegen.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="docs-callout docs-callout-tip">
          <div class="docs-callout-label">Tipp</div>
          <div class="docs-callout-body">Per Tastatur: <span class="docs-mono">Cmd+N</span> öffnet das Launcher-Popup in der nächsten leeren Zelle.</div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Die Statusleiste (unterer Rand)</span></h3>
        <p class="docs-p">Deine Kommandozentrale. Von links nach rechts:</p>
        <div class="docs-table">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col"><div>Element</div><div>Was es tut</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-label">Voice-Pill</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Sprachsteuerung ein/aus. LED zeigt Status: aus / grün (bereit) / rot (nimmt auf) / gelb (verarbeitet).</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">spalten +/-</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Grid-Spalten hinzufügen oder entfernen. Maximum 7.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">zeilen +/-</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Grid-Zeilen hinzufügen oder entfernen. Maximum 3.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">workspaces</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Workspace- und Persona-Editor öffnen.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">cyber factory</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Cyber Factory starten/stoppen. Punkt-Indikator wenn aktiv.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">bugreport</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Bugreport-Dialog öffnen.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">sidebar</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Seitenleiste ein/ausblenden. LED leuchtet wenn Inhalt wartet.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Theme-Name</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Klick wechselt zum nächsten visuellen Theme.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">info</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Einstellungen, Shortcuts, Feature-Liste.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Version</div><div class="docs-table-desc">App-Version (rechts, nicht klickbar).</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ §02 · Sessions ═══ -->
    <section id="sessions" class="docs-section">
      <div class="docs-inner">
        <div class="cm-section-header-meta">
          <span class="cm-section-header-num">§ 02</span>
          <span class="cm-section-header-line"></span>
          <span>kapitel</span>
        </div>
        <h2>Sessions — deine KI-Arbeitsplätze</h2>
        <p class="docs-lead">Eine Session ist ein separater Telefonanruf mit Claude. Eigenes Gedächtnis (Context Window), eigene Dateien, eigene Aufgabe. Sessions sind voneinander unabhängig.</p>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Session öffnen — drei Wege</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-table">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col"><div>Weg</div><div>So gehts</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-label">Über Preset</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Klick auf + → Tab "Presets" → Preset wählen. Session startet mit vordefiniertem Verhalten, Persona und Projekt-Kontext.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Über Pfad</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Klick auf + → Tab "Path" → Ordner wählen oder eingeben → Start. Nackte Claude-Session im gewählten Verzeichnis.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Über Workspace</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Workspace anwenden — das Grid wird automatisch befüllt. Ein Klick, alles steht.</div></div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Zellen-Steuerung</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-table">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-3col"><div>Button</div><div>Aktion</div><div>Beschreibung</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-3col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-key">&uarr;</div><div class="docs-table-label-mid">Expand</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Zelle auf volle Grid-Höhe expandieren (nur bei 2+ Zeilen).</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-3col"><div class="docs-table-key">&darr;</div><div class="docs-table-label-mid">Collapse</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Zurück zur normalen Höhe.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-3col"><div class="docs-table-key">&hArr;</div><div class="docs-table-label-mid">Switch</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Projekt wechseln ohne Session zu schließen.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-3col"><div class="docs-table-key">$</div><div class="docs-table-label-mid">Shell</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Shell öffnen im Projektverzeichnis. Kein Claude, normales Terminal.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-3col"><div class="docs-table-key">&times;</div><div class="docs-table-label-mid">Close</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Session beenden und Zelle freigeben.</div></div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Fokus, Context, Crash-Sicherheit</span></h3>
        <ul class="docs-list">
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Fokus:</strong> Klick auf die Kopfleiste setzt Fokus. Tastatureingaben gehen an die fokussierte Zelle. Drag and Drop tauscht Positionen.</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Context-Anzeige:</strong> Grün = viel Platz. Orange ab 80% = wird eng. Rot ab 90% = fast voll, Session muss bald vergessen.</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Crash-Sicherheit:</strong> Sessions überleben Abstürze dank tmux. Beim Neustart erscheint ein Recovery-Dialog — übernehmen oder beenden.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ §03 · Grid ═══ -->
    <section id="grid" class="docs-section">
      <div class="docs-inner">
        <div class="cm-section-header-meta">
          <span class="cm-section-header-num">§ 03</span>
          <span class="cm-section-header-line"></span>
          <span>kapitel</span>
        </div>
        <h2>Das Grid anpassen</h2>
        <p class="docs-lead">Ein bis 21 Zellen. So viel oder so wenig wie du brauchst.</p>

        <ul class="docs-list">
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><span class="docs-mono">spalten +/-</span> und <span class="docs-mono">zeilen +/-</span> in der Statusleiste</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span>Minimum 1&times;1 (eine Zelle), Maximum 7&times;3 (21 Zellen)</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span>Das Fenster passt seine Größe automatisch an</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span>Bei 2+ Zeilen: <span class="docs-mono">&uarr;</span> streckt eine Zelle über die volle Höhe — gut zum Lesen langer Ausgaben</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Typische Layouts</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-table">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col"><div>Layout</div><div>Wofür</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-label">2&times;1</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Zwei Sessions nebeneinander — Standard für den Alltag.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">3&times;1</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Drei Spalten — z.B. Frontend / Backend / Tests.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">2&times;2</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Vier Zellen — Cyber Factory + drei Worker.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ §04 · Voice ═══ -->
    <section id="voice" class="docs-section">
      <div class="docs-inner">
        <div class="cm-section-header-meta">
          <span class="cm-section-header-num">§ 04</span>
          <span class="cm-section-header-line"></span>
          <span>kapitel</span>
        </div>
        <h2>Sprachsteuerung</h2>
        <p class="docs-lead">Lokale Spracherkennung — kein Netzwerk, keine Cloud. Voice-Pill in der Statusleiste oder Ctrl+Shift+Space.</p>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>LED-Status</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-led-row">
          <div class="docs-led-item"><span class="docs-led-dot docs-led-off"></span><span class="docs-led-label">aus</span><span class="docs-led-desc">Voice ist deaktiviert</span></div>
          <div class="docs-led-item"><span class="docs-led-dot docs-led-green"></span><span class="docs-led-label">grün</span><span class="docs-led-desc">bereit, hört nicht zu</span></div>
          <div class="docs-led-item"><span class="docs-led-dot docs-led-red"></span><span class="docs-led-label">rot</span><span class="docs-led-desc">nimmt gerade auf</span></div>
          <div class="docs-led-item"><span class="docs-led-dot docs-led-yellow"></span><span class="docs-led-label">gelb</span><span class="docs-led-desc">verarbeitet — bitte warten</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="docs-callout docs-callout-rule">
          <div class="docs-callout-label">Faustregel · Wichtig</div>
          <div class="docs-callout-body">Gesprochener Text wird eingefügt aber <em>nicht automatisch gesendet</em>. Du kannst lesen, korrigieren, dann per <span class="docs-mono">"abschicken"</span> oder Enter senden.</div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Sprachbefehle · Text</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-table docs-table-compact">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col"><div>Sage</div><div>Bewirkt</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-label">"abschicken" / "absenden" / "senden"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Enter drücken (Text abschicken).</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">"neue zeile"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Zeilenumbruch einfügen.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">alles andere</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Wird als Text transkribiert und eingefügt.</div></div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Sprachbefehle · Scrollen</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-table docs-table-compact">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col"><div>Sage</div><div>Bewirkt</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-label">"hoch" / "rauf"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Eine Seite hoch scrollen.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">"runter" / "weiter"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Eine Seite runter scrollen.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">"ganz hoch" / "anfang"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Ganz nach oben.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">"ganz runter" / "ende"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Ganz nach unten.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">"zum marker" / "lesestart"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Zum Anfang der letzten Antwort springen.</div></div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Sprachbefehle · Grid-Navigation</span></h3>
        <div class="docs-table docs-table-compact">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col"><div>Sage</div><div>Bewirkt</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-label">"grid hoch"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Fokus auf die Zelle darüber.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">"grid runter"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Fokus auf die Zelle darunter.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">"grid links"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Fokus auf die Zelle links.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">"grid rechts"</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Fokus auf die Zelle rechts.</div></div>
        </div>
        <p class="docs-p">Varianten wie <span class="docs-mono">grit</span>, <span class="docs-mono">zelle</span>, <span class="docs-mono">focus</span> werden ebenfalls erkannt.</p>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Voice Pin · Bluetooth-Fernbedienung</span></h3>
        <ul class="docs-list">
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Voice Pin:</strong> Spracheingabe an eine bestimmte Session pinnen — die Stimme geht immer dorthin, egal welche Zelle gerade fokussiert ist.</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Bluetooth-Clicker</strong> (z.B. AB Shutter). Auto-Modus: Knopfdruck = sofort senden. Manual-Modus: Knopfdruck = Aufnahme starten/stoppen, explizit senden.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ §05 · Sidebar ═══ -->
    <section id="sidebar" class="docs-section">
      <div class="docs-inner">
        <div class="cm-section-header-meta">
          <span class="cm-section-header-num">§ 05</span>
          <span class="cm-section-header-line"></span>
          <span>kapitel</span>
        </div>
        <h2>Die Seitenleiste</h2>
        <p class="docs-lead">Klick auf 'sidebar' in der Statusleiste. Mehrere Tabs, verschiedene Funktionen.</p>

        <div class="docs-table">
          <div class="docs-table-header docs-table-2col"><div>Tab</div><div>Inhalt</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col docs-table-row-first"><div class="docs-table-label">Messages</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Nachrichten zwischen Sessions — sichtbar bei Multi-Session-Arbeit (Cyber Factory etc.).</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Background</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Sessions die laufen aber nicht im Grid sichtbar sind. Karten mit Live-Vorschau (5s-Refresh). Klick holt die Session ins Grid.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Notes</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Notiz-Browser. Suchfeld, Tag-Chips zum Filtern, Doppelklick öffnet eine Notiz im Grid als Editor-Zelle.</div></div>
          <div class="docs-table-row docs-table-2col"><div class="docs-table-label">Companion Memory</div><div class="docs-table-desc">Gespeicherte Erinnerungen der Companion-Session. Durchsuchbar und einsehbar.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="docs-callout docs-callout-tip">
          <div class="docs-callout-label">Tipp</div>
          <div class="docs-callout-body">Der <span class="docs-mono">&#x29C9;</span>-Button oben löst die Sidebar als eigenes Fenster — ideal für Multi-Monitor-Setups.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ §06 · Notizen ═══ -->
    <section id="notes" class="docs-section">
      <div class="docs-inner">
        <div class="cm-section-header-meta">
          <span class="cm-section-header-num">§ 06</span>
          <span class="cm-section-header-line"></span>
          <span>kapitel</span>
        </div>
        <h2>Notizen</h2>
        <p class="docs-lead">Markdown-Editor (CodeMirror) in Grid-Zellen. Überschriften, fett, kursiv, Links, Code-Blöcke, Zitate.</p>

        <h3 class="docs-subhead"><span class="docs-subhead-dot"></span><span>Erstellen, Speichern, Auto-Tags</span></h3>
        <ul class="docs-list">
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Neue Notiz:</strong> Über Launcher-Popup → Tab "Notes" → "Neue Notiz", oder <span class="docs-mono">+</span> in der Tab-Leiste eines offenen Editors</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Speichern + Auto-Tagging:</strong> <span class="docs-mono">Cmd+S</span> — speichert und schlägt automatisch Tags vor (lokales KI-Modell, max 5 Tags pro Notiz)</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Auto-Save:</strong> Nach 2 Sekunden Inaktivität (ohne Tagging)</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Löschen:</strong> Mülleimer-Icon in der Tab-Leiste, mit Bestätigung</span></li>
          <li><span class="docs-list-marker">&rsaquo;</span><span><strong>Handoff-Notizen:</strong> spezielle Notizen für Wissenstransfer zwischen Sessions — wenn eine Session ihre Arbeit beendet, übergibt sie den Kontext an die nächste</span></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="docs-callout docs-callout-rule">
          <div class="docs-callout-label">Faustregel · Memory vs. Notes</div>
          <div class="docs-callout-body">Was der User sehen, teilen oder in Obsidian lesen können soll, ist eine <strong>Note</strong> (Markdown-Datei). Was zur internen Run-Verwaltung gehört (Worker-Status, Risk-Reviews etc.), ist <strong>Memory</strong> (nicht sichtbar).</div>
        </div>

        <div class="docs-screenshot-row">
          <div class="docs-screenshot-sm">
            <img src="/images/screenshots/detail-notes-editor.webp" alt="Notes-Editor mit Feature-Spec" loading="lazy" />
            <span>Notes-Editor</span>
          </div>
          <div class="docs-screenshot-sm">
            <img src="/images/screenshots/detail-testcase-view.webp" alt="Testcase-View" loading="lazy" />
            <span>Testcase-View</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ §07 · Projekte ═══ -->
    <section id="projects" class="docs-section">
      <div class="docs-inner">
        <div class="cm-section-header-meta">
          <span class="cm-section-header-num">§ 07</span>
